**Design Rationale Summary:**

| Task | Rule Type | Why |
|------|-----------|-----|
| find coal_ore | position_near_with_facing | Find/locate task — player must navigate toward and face the coal ore cluster at [5,0,5]. Distance 16 + facing 60° models "player can see it." |
| mine yellow_concrete_powder | inventory_has | Mine task — yellow concrete powder drops itself when mined. Player starts with 0, so ≥1 confirms mining. |
| sell Stone | inventory_has (emerald) | Trade/sell task — selling 20 stone yields 1 emerald. Player starts with 0 emeralds (verified), so ≥1 confirms sale. |
| trade for Iron Axe | inventory_has (iron_axe) | Trade task — buying iron axe puts it in inventory. Player starts with 0 iron axes, so ≥1 confirms trade. |

**Economy verification:** 64 stone ÷ 20 per trade = 3 emeralds max. Iron axe costs 3 emeralds. Exactly sufficient — no slack but achievable.

